+# Accounts Service
+
+Customer accounts and staff support operations for a multi-tenant banking platform.
+
+## Language
+
+**Support case**:
+A customer-service issue associated with an account and handled by a support user.
+
+**Assignee**:
+The support user currently responsible for handling a support case.
+_Avoid_: account assignment (that is a separate relationship between support users and accounts)
+
+**Reassignment**:
+A back-office change that replaces a support case's assignee with another support user identifier.
