@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Case assignees use platform user identifiers
+
+The case reassignment API stores the supplied support user identifier without resolving it against a local user table. This service has no identity directory; tenant and role claims are authoritative at request time, so identity existence and lifecycle validation remain the platform identity service's responsibility.
